Okay, you're getting advice here from a non-ascender
protection run fanatic, so beware.

Healers are an easier role for practicing the
protection run, because of that huge starting stack
of zorkmids and those lovely starting healing
potions you can quaff on the DLVL:1 up-stairs before
taking a step, but work with what you enjoy.

